---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Telestar Corporation"
  description="Terms of service governing cloud communications, hosted PBX platforms, acceptable use, and customer responsibilities with Telestar Corporation."
>
  <div class="bg-slate-50 py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <nav class="flex items-center text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 mb-6 space-x-2">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-brand-cyan-dark transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-slate-800">Terms of Service</span>
      </nav>

      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-8 mb-10">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Standard terms governing the delivery, use, and management of Telestar Corporation cloud communications, hosted voice, and collaboration platforms.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          Effective Date: September 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Document Body -->
      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By subscribing to, accessing, or utilizing telecommunications services provided by Telestar Corporation ("Telestar", "we", "our", or "us"), the subscribing business entity and its designated end users ("Customer" or "you") agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">2. Description of Services</h2>
          <p>
            Telestar provides business-class communications solutions, including cloud PBX telephone service, unified messaging, desktop and mobile calling applications, video conferencing, and real-time cloud file backup (SecuriSync). Services require an active broadband internet connection and compatible IP telephone equipment or software clients.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">3. Emergency 911 / E911 Acknowledgement</h2>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 text-amber-950 text-sm space-y-2">
            <p class="font-bold text-amber-900">Mandatory Emergency Services Notice:</p>
            <p>
              Customer acknowledges and agrees that interconnected VoIP 911 service differs from traditional wireline 911 service. VoIP 911 calls depend upon electrical power and internet connectivity and require accurate registration of each extension's physical street address.
            </p>
            <p>
              Customer agrees to review and comply with our complete <a href="/e911" class="font-semibold underline text-amber-900 hover:text-amber-950">Emergency 911 Policy</a> before utilizing services.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">4. Acceptable Use Policy</h2>
          <p>Customer agrees not to use or permit the use of Telestar services for any unlawful, fraudulent, or prohibited purpose, including but not limited to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
            <li>Transmitting autodialed calls or prerecorded marketing messages in violation of the Telephone Consumer Protection Act (TCPA) or the Telemarketing Sales Rule (TSR).</li>
            <li>Originating spoofed, deceptive, or misleading caller ID information in violation of the Truth in Caller ID Act and STIR/SHAKEN standards.</li>
            <li>Transmitting unsolicited commercial bulk faxes or SMS messages.</li>
            <li>Engaging in illegal toll fraud or unauthorized network penetration.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">5. Billing, Surcharges &amp; Taxes</h2>
          <p>
            Customer agrees to pay all monthly recurring charges, per-seat licensing fees, toll usage charges, and applicable government-mandated taxes, regulatory recovery fees, and Universal Service Fund (USF) surcharges as outlined in your service agreement.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">6. Equipment &amp; Number Porting</h2>
          <p>
            Telestar assists customers with the porting of telephone numbers from previous carriers pursuant to FCC rules. Number porting depends upon accurate Customer Service Records (CSR) and cooperation from the relinquishing carrier. Telestar does not claim ownership over telephone numbers lawfully ported by the Customer.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, Telestar shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or for any loss of profits, data, or business opportunities arising from internet service provider disruptions, electrical power failures, emergency 911 routing delays, or carrier network outages.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">8. Contact Information</h2>
          <p>
            For commercial inquiries, billing support, or service agreements, please contact:
          </p>
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xs space-y-1 text-sm">
            <p><strong>Telestar Corporation</strong></p>
            <p>Direct Phone: <a href="tel:+18049308400" class="text-brand-cyan-dark font-semibold hover:underline">(804) 930-8400</a></p>
            <p>Support Email: <a href="mailto:support@telestarcorp.com" class="text-brand-cyan-dark font-semibold hover:underline">support@telestarcorp.com</a></p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
